+       
+       *Implementation of `getTextureValue(vpos)`:*
+       1.  Calculate the Z-tile index for the current position:
+           $$ z_{p1} = \lfloor \text{vpos.z} \times \text{uTiles} \rfloor $$
+       2.  Calculate the Z-tile index for the next slice:
