+           $$ xt_1 = \text{mod}(\text{index}_1, \text{uDimension}) $$
+           $$ yt_1 = \lfloor \text{index}_1 / \text{uDimension} \rfloor $$
+           $$ xt_2 = \text{mod}(\text{index}_2, \text{uDimension}) $$
